{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/23600","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/23600/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/23600/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/23600/events","html_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/issues/23600","id":318768982,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUzMTg3Njg5ODI=","number":23600,"title":"HttpClient#put with `observe: events` and generic as return type doesn't take in `reportProgress: true`","user":{"login":"diagramatics","id":5153378,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNTMzNzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5153378?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/diagramatics","html_url":"https://github.com/diagramatics","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diagramatics/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diagramatics/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diagramatics/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diagramatics/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diagramatics/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diagramatics/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diagramatics/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diagramatics/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diagramatics/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":130606843,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzA2MDY4NDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/labels/type:%20bug/fix","name":"type: bug/fix","color":"EEEEEE","default":false,"description":null},{"id":226601219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMjY2MDEyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/labels/open%20for%20contributions","name":"open for contributions","color":"008672","default":false,"description":"An issue that is suitable for a community contributor (based on its complexity/scope)."},{"id":375496864,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzU0OTY4NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/labels/freq1:%20low","name":"freq1: low","color":"fbca04","default":false,"description":null},{"id":644231098,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw2NDQyMzEwOTg=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/labels/area:%20common/http","name":"area: common/http","color":"c5def5","default":false,"description":"Issues related to HTTP and HTTP Client"},{"id":1688825891,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNjg4ODI1ODkx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/labels/state:%20confirmed","name":"state: confirmed","color":"5ce05c","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/milestones/82","html_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/milestone/82","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/milestones/82/labels","id":3045967,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lMzA0NTk2Nw==","number":82,"title":"Backlog","description":"Milestone for triaged issues that have not yet been scheduled for resolution.","creator":{"login":"IgorMinar","id":216296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNjI5Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar","html_url":"https://github.com/IgorMinar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":681,"closed_issues":22796,"state":"open","created_at":"2018-01-18T16:52:20Z","updated_at":"2026-03-11T09:12:24Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":3,"created_at":"2018-04-30T01:39:36Z","updated_at":"2020-10-17T16:27:00Z","closed_at":"2020-09-16T22:28:28Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"<!--\r\nPLEASE HELP US PROCESS GITHUB ISSUES FASTER BY PROVIDING THE FOLLOWING INFORMATION.\r\n\r\nISSUES MISSING IMPORTANT INFORMATION MAY BE CLOSED WITHOUT INVESTIGATION.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## I'm submitting a...\r\n<!-- Check one of the following options with \"x\" -->\r\n<pre><code>\r\n[ ] Regression (a behavior that used to work and stopped working in a new release)\r\n[x] Bug report  <!-- Please search GitHub for a similar issue or PR before submitting -->\r\n[ ] Performance issue\r\n[ ] Feature request\r\n[ ] Documentation issue or request\r\n[ ] Support request => Please do not submit support request here, instead see https://github.com/angular/angular/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#question\r\n[ ] Other... Please describe:\r\n</code></pre>\r\n\r\n## Current behavior\r\n<!-- Describe how the issue manifests. -->\r\n\r\nConsider this:\r\n```ts\r\nthis.http.put<{}>('endpoint', {}, {\r\n  reportProgress: true,\r\n  observe: 'events',\r\n});\r\n\r\nthis.http.put<{}>('endpoint', {}, {\r\n  reportProgress: true,\r\n});\r\n```\r\n\r\nBasically, the top `HttpClient#put` call doesn't compile in TS from a non-matching override function definition. Bottom does.\r\n\r\nAccording to: https://github.com/angular/angular/blob/master/tools/public_api_guard/common/http.d.ts#L1163-L1170\r\n\r\nThere's no way to specify `reportProgress: true` when you're using a generic type to specify the return type for `HttpClient#put` and the configuration `observe: 'events'` to exist. Compare this to:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/angular/angular/blob/master/tools/public_api_guard/common/http.d.ts#L1183-L1194\r\n\r\nWhere there is the definition for it if you're not returning a generic type as a part of `HttpEvent`.\r\n\r\n\r\n## Expected behavior\r\n<!-- Describe what the desired behavior would be. -->\r\n\r\nSupposedly you add `reportProgress?: boolean` into the override definition? Can definitely make a quick PR if this is the case.\r\n\r\n\r\n## Minimal reproduction of the problem with instructions\r\n<!--\r\nFor bug reports please provide the *STEPS TO REPRODUCE* and if possible a *MINIMAL DEMO* of the problem via\r\nhttps://stackblitz.com or similar (you can use this template as a starting point: https://stackblitz.com/fork/angular-gitter).\r\n-->\r\n\r\nhttps://stackblitz.com/edit/angular-gitter-nsqoef?file=app%2Fapp.component.ts shows the TS compile error.\r\n\r\n## What is the motivation / use case for changing the behavior?\r\n<!-- Describe the motivation or the concrete use case. -->\r\n\r\nWell, type correctness? I don't think that type of PUT request wasn't supported. I assume like every other methods, they are small wrappers to create an `HttpRequest` for `HttpClient#request`, which handles `reportProgress` and `observe: events` the same for any types of requests.\r\n\r\n## Environment\r\n\r\nConsidering the code is still in `master`, I'm assuming all versions of Angular to this date and all versions of TypeScript.","closed_by":{"login":"AndrewKushnir","id":43554145,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTU0MTQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43554145?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrewKushnir","html_url":"https://github.com/AndrewKushnir","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrewKushnir/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrewKushnir/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrewKushnir/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrewKushnir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrewKushnir/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrewKushnir/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrewKushnir/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrewKushnir/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrewKushnir/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/23600/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":7,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/23600/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}